    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch03-20: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.38";
    dc:description "Outputs from many formal systems can be generated, but the central taxonomy and dominance criterion require substantial interpretation. Available surveys cannot adequately cover the claim's open-ended scope or exclude alternative behavior classes.";
