    dc:type "resolution-route/computation";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Construct a representative, preregistered sample of formal systems and an independently validated classifier for the four behavior classes, then measure coverage and residual classes. High coverage across sampled families supports a restricted version; frequent unclassified behavior refutes it there.";
